sequenceDiagram
  participant DevOps
  participant Job as database-initialize Job
  participant Maria as MariaDB Pod
  participant Mongo as MongoDB Pod
  DevOps->>Job: Copy backup archives to /tmp
  Job->>Job: Read backupTimestamp ConfigMap
  Job->>Maria: Wait for ready pod
  Job->>Maria: Stream gunzip SQL into mysql
  Job->>Mongo: Wait for ready pod
  Job->>Mongo: Copy archive and run mongorestore
  Job-->>DevOps: Database initialization completed
